    {
      "id": 14116969,
      "body": "Ryan 🤝 Me, agreeing that Python is a lot easier than C++\n\nI think HackerRank might also be good for practicing interview coding questions. Using and knowing both Leetcode and HackerRank is a good strategy to improve your odds at getting the job.\n\nGlassdoor might also be good for looking up what kind of questions other people have experienced in the technical interview.\n\nAlso, focus on your soft skills too. It's not a good idea to focus solely on the technical aspect. Work on communicating clearly, having humor in the interview process, and overall being fun and easy to work with. ",
      "body_json": {
        "type": "doc",
        "attrs": {
          "schemaVersion": "v1"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ryan 🤝 Me, agreeing that Python is a lot easier than C++"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I think HackerRank might also be good for practicing interview coding questions. Using and knowing both Leetcode and HackerRank is a good strategy to improve your odds at getting the job."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Glassdoor might also be good for looking up what kind of questions other people have experienced in the technical interview."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Also, focus on your soft skills too. It's not a good idea to focus solely on the technical aspect. Work on communicating clearly, having humor in the interview process, and overall being fun and easy to work with."
              }
            ]
